      "updated": 1791480000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Plain language: ask one brand factory for a whole matching set of things instead of choosing each concrete class yourself.\nProblem: choosing a Honda car and Toyota truck by separate conditionals can mix brands and spread construction decisions through the app.\nThis lesson uses Abstract Factory to create two related product types (Car and Truck) for a chosen brand family.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 17,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Plain language: ask one brand factory for a whole matching set of things instead of choosing each concrete class yourself.\nProblem: choosing a Honda car and Toyota truck by separate conditionals can mix brands and spread construction decisions through the app.\nThis lesson uses Abstract Factory to create two related product types (Car and Truck) for a chosen brand family.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "a1"
    },
