      "text": "WITH ABSTRACT FACTORY\nClient chooses HondaFactory or ToyotaFactory.\n\nThat factory creates both products from its brand family via common interfaces.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 16,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "WITH ABSTRACT FACTORY\nClient chooses HondaFactory or ToyotaFactory.\n\nThat factory creates both products from its brand family via common interfaces.",
