      "updated": 1791480000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "TRADE-OFFS\nNew brand: add its factory and products; client logic stays unchanged.\nNew product type: update the factory interface and each concrete factory.\nFactories implement an interface by inheritance; products use interfaces too. Prefer this only when families/compatibility matter; it adds classes and setup.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 14,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "TRADE-OFFS\nNew brand: add its factory and products; client logic stays unchanged.\nNew product type: update the factory interface and each concrete factory.\nFactories implement an interface by inheritance; products use interfaces too. Prefer this only when families/compatibility matter; it adds classes and setup.",
